"|  $3H_2O$ (18o,24e) |  36              |  344622096        |  399424             |  0.90                    |  24                 | 5174 s        | 130 s             |\n"
"|  $N_2$ (20o,14e)   |  40              |  6009350400       |  9012004            |  1.20                    |  21                 | 46547 s       | 258 s             |\n"
